test f httpdownstreamsessiontest  invariantviolation    
  folly  delayeddestruction  destructorguard g httpsession handler   addsimplestricthandler txn   handler- txn   
    
  handler- expectheaders         handler- sendbody 100       
 
  expect call  handler   oninvariantviolation     willonce         
      
    check txn- cansendheaders     
    txn- sendheaders getresponse 500  0    
      
 
  sendrequest getgetrequest expect call  handler   detachtransaction   
  flushrequestsandloopn 1   
  evbloopnonblockn 1   
 
  expect call callbacks   onheaderscomplete        willonce auto msg    
    expect eq msg- getstatuscode    500   
      
 
  parseoutput  clientcodec    
  gracefulshutdown    
  
 
