  folly  delayeddestruction  destructorguard g httpsession handler   addsimplestricthandler    
  handler- expectheaders msg    
    expect msg- isingresswebsocketupgrade     
    handler- sendreplycode 401   
      
  handler- expecteom    
  handler- expectdetachtransaction wsreq   getgetrequest    
  wsreq setegresswebsocketupgrade    
  sendrequest wsreq flushrequests evbloopnonblockn 2   
 
    
    
  expect call mockcontroller   getrequesthandler        times 0   
  http1xcodec codec transportdirection  upstream req   getgetrequest    
  codec generateheader requests   codec createstream    req flushrequests evbloopnonblockn 2   
 
  gracefulshutdown    
  
 
